                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e5da0a6-c94b-32aa-ad27-e898ccb30ff4",
                                        "entry_id": "83323501-25fc-3b1e-be3c-3b9b7d4e0e7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition or degree of being pale or of lacking color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00ac621f-b39b-4c86-8697-4bb9bfcd3d9c",
                                                "sense_id": "3e5da0a6-c94b-32aa-ad27-e898ccb30ff4",
                                                "text": "The cold weather intensified the paleness of the landscape."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "745dba57-a482-4fdc-97d6-86fd9f458f9c",
                        "source_entry_id": "fcb08f33-4463-30bd-8fc1-315fe5d0e2e4",
                        "source_sense_id": "ddb1d982-2a85-3275-8c76-a7362cd9e3e8",
                        "source_sense_description": "die Eigenschaft und der Zustand, blass zu sein (wenig Farbe zu haben)",
                        "target_lang_word": "pallor",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pallor",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc0581ce-1394-366a-afd9-0c5bec3cbcae",
                                        "entry_id": "66550598-758f-3d1d-9719-0ba346906172",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unnatural paleness, especially as a sign of sickness or distress."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "305322c5-d7cf-4447-9e5e-b284dd20e2e3",
                                                "sense_id": "fc0581ce-1394-366a-afd9-0c5bec3cbcae",
                                                "text": "pallor of the complexion"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3f8dad8-3ee7-4064-92c3-f0ad3e070b70",
                                                "sense_id": "fc0581ce-1394-366a-afd9-0c5bec3cbcae",
                                                "text": "‘Sir,’ said the butler, turning to a sort of mottled pallor, ‘that thing was not my master, and there’s the truth. My master’—here he looked round him and began to whisper—‘is a tall fine build of a man, and this was more of a dwarf.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc5991f5-f70f-43c3-bd5b-2317ce5f737d",
                                                "sense_id": "fc0581ce-1394-366a-afd9-0c5bec3cbcae",
                                                "text": "For the rest, his ears were pale, and at the tops extremely pointed; the chin was broad and strong, and the cheeks firm though thin. The general effect was one of extraordinary pallor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "381b145f-5459-4e90-8709-bfed8257260d",
                                                "sense_id": "fc0581ce-1394-366a-afd9-0c5bec3cbcae",
                                                "text": "Over those seamed cheeks there was a certain pallor, a grayness caught from many a vigil"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97dbd2bd-d57f-4aa9-8c14-a930e97a1e47",
                                                "sense_id": "fc0581ce-1394-366a-afd9-0c5bec3cbcae",
                                                "text": "Catch-22 is defined by the sickly pallor of its visual palette (a jaundiced tint that at least goes with Yossarian’s point of view and phony liver pains) and the way it makes the slog of its characters’ deployment a little too literal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b1aacb4-e4c9-438a-b04b-4686513c0806",
                        "source_entry_id": "fcb08f33-4463-30bd-8fc1-315fe5d0e2e4",
                        "source_sense_id": "ddb1d982-2a85-3275-8c76-a7362cd9e3e8",
                        "source_sense_description": "die Eigenschaft und der Zustand, blass zu sein (wenig Farbe zu haben)",
                        "target_lang_word": "bladość",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bladość",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5888cba-7500-3a36-8dd0-ab17d9821897",
                                        "entry_id": "7ffab67a-e68b-3010-9439-ff55b05e7389",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "cecha tego, co blade; cecha tych, którzy są bladzi"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b77a1bc-5cdf-49fe-bb06-3b151ebc472a",
                                                "sense_id": "f5888cba-7500-3a36-8dd0-ab17d9821897",
                                                "text": "Już sina bladość ustąpiła z jej policzków, na których zarysowywał się chwilami lekki rumieniec"
                                            }
